Plugin-Version: 1.0.0
Plugin-Class: org.gameyfin.plugins.store.gogdb.GogDbPlugin
Plugin-Id: org.gameyfin.plugins.store.gogdb
Plugin-Name: GOG Builds (GOGDB)
Plugin-Description: Tracks the build history of GOG products and suggests their editions.<br>
 Data comes from the community-run GOGDB archive (gogdb.org), which is not an official GOG API.<br>
 This plugin cannot search for games. Enable another GOG store plugin to search; without one, products can only be added by ID or URL.
Plugin-Short-Description: GOG builds and editions via gogdb.org
Plugin-Author: grimsi
Plugin-License: MIT
Plugin-Url: https://github.com/gameyfin
